    complete(&ep->re_done);
out:
Reason:
By redirecting early exit paths to the new `out_dec` label, the atomic decrement and possible completion are always executed after the initial increment. This ensures `re_receiving` is properly decremented and the drain completion is triggered when needed, preventing the hang.

